<title>FRANCE: Via Banque swings to 178 mln Ffr H1 loss.</title>
<headline>Via Banque swings to 178 mln Ffr H1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					loss  178  vs    profit  16</p>
<p>    Operating				profit 25  vs    profit  60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional	   profit 21  vs    profit  83</p>
<p>NOTE - Via Banque gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the big drop in operating profit was due to a 24 million franc restructuring provision, and predicted a breakeven for the second half.</p>
<p>Its equity at the end of June was 1.66 billion francs.</p>
<p>The board would not issue an advance payment on the dividend.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
